+/*
+ * Unified support.
+ *
+ * A single "Get help" entry replaces the retired, separate bot and Happiness
+ * Engineer menu entries. One list/repository path serves both conversation
+ * kinds, every detail experience is derived from conversation status and reply
+ * capability, and replies are created optimistically so a failed send never
+ * costs the user their input.
+ */
+
